flowchart TD
    S0(["🚀 Start: SLES 16\nInstruqt builder sandbox"]):::start

    S1["Step 1\nClone repo\nInstall prerequisites\nansible · kubectl · jq · xorriso\nansible collections"]:::step

    subgraph ANSIBLE["🔧 ansible-playbook — runs both roles"]
        A1["kvm_host role\n• KVM packages via zypper\n• virtqemud: security_driver=none\n• IP forwarding\n• firewalld port-forward (DNAT)\n• firewalld rules"]:::role
        FLUSH["meta: flush_handlers\n(restart virtqemud before vms role)"]:::flush
        A2["vms role\n• Redefine virbr0 with static DHCP\n• Storage pool check\n• Download Harvester 1.8.0 ISO\n• Create 3×270GB + 60GB qcow2\n• Render Harvester config ISOs\n• Create Rancher cloud-init ISO\n• Define 4 KVM VMs (idempotent)"]:::role
        A1 --> FLUSH --> A2
    end

    S3["deploy-vms.sh\n• virsh start harvester1\n• Wait for Harvester API :443\n• Start harvester2 (90s stagger)\n• Start harvester3\n• Start rancher VM"]:::step

    S4["⏳ Harvester installs\n(40–90 min)\ntail -f serial logs"]:::wait

    S5["setup-rancher.sh\n• Install K3s + Helm on rancher VM\n• Deploy Rancher Prime 2.13.1\n• Set admin password\n• Import Harvester cluster\n• Eject installer ISOs"]:::step

    S6["Manual steps\n• Install Harvester UI plugin v1.8.0\n• Upload openSUSE Leap 16 image"]:::manual

    S7["Verify build checklist\n• 3 nodes Ready\n• Rancher cluster Active\n• UI plugin installed\n• Leap 16 image active"]:::check

    S8["virsh shutdown all VMs\n(4× shut off)"]:::step

    S9(["💾 Save image\ninstruqt track image create\nsuse/suse-virt-rodeo-180"]):::done

